                "jsCode": "// The Meta configuration is served by Laravel (/admin/whatsapp). While WhatsApp\n// is disabled or keys are missing, stop here without error: nothing is sent.\nconst cfg = ($input.first().json || {}).data || {};\nif (!cfg.enabled) { return []; }\n\n// The HTTP node replaced the item: restart from the verified webhook.\nreturn $('Verify HMAC').all();"
