                "height": 420,
                "content": "## wedding-whatsapp\n\nOutbound notifications and Meta inbound events.\n\n**Laravel webhooks** on `/webhook/wedding-whatsapp-outbound`: `round.started`, `lead.accepted`, `lead.opened_to_marketplace`.\n\n**Meta webhook** → `/webhook/wedding-whatsapp-inbound` (GET verification + POST events).\n\n**Meta configuration** is entered in Laravel (`/admin/whatsapp`) and read at each run through `GET /api/v1/n8n/whatsapp-config`. While WhatsApp is disabled there, sending stops at the Gate WhatsApp Enabled node without error.\n\n**After import**: Settings → Error Workflow → `wedding-error-handler`.\n\nVariables: `LARAVEL_API_URL`, `LARAVEL_API_TOKEN`, `WEDDING_WEBHOOK_SECRET`."
            },
